{"nodes": [{"id": "skill_user_journey", "label": "Skill: user-journey (section 11, tasks 11.1-11.2)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/user-journey/SKILL.md", "source_location": "frontmatter + full body", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A canonical text structure is required so the text-to-activity-diagram conversion comes out clean."}, {"id": "skill_task_11_1_journey_text", "label": "Task 11.1 - write the user journey as structured text", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/user-journey/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 3.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "skill_task_11_2_activity_diagram", "label": "Task 11.2 - convert the journey into an activity diagram", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/user-journey/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "skill_journey_canonical_structure", "label": "Canonical journey block: Journey / Actor / Start / numbered steps / Decision / End", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/user-journey/SKILL.md", "source_location": "sections 1-2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One numbered step = one action or one decision; every branch needs a go-to target; one actor per journey block; never drop a step the trainee mentioned, and suggest a missing one rather than adding it silently."}, {"id": "skill_warning_forgotten_branches", "label": "Warning: the trainee always describes the happy path - ask for the four branch cases", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/user-journey/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 3.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not signed in, item not found or unavailable, wrong input, went back or abandoned midway. A journey of eight steps with zero decisions is probably incomplete."}, {"id": "skill_warning_return_after_interruption", "label": "Warning: after an interruption (login, payment, permission) ask where the user returns", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/user-journey/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 3.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In the real build 'then back to the chosen service' became an explicit journey point because the trainer insisted; without it the user would be lost after signing in."}, {"id": "skill_concept_swimlanes_or_colors", "label": "Rule: a lane per party including the system, but swap lanes for colours if it gets crowded", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/user-journey/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 3.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Readability beats completeness, and the trainer literally asked for it that way - preferred shape plus a fallback. Present the diagram as an image so the trainee never opens a file."}, {"id": "skill_concept_diagram_correct_not_comfortable", "label": "Limit: the diagram proves the steps are correct, not that they feel comfortable", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/user-journey/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 3.5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A step can be perfectly right and still look broken - booking took a noticeable time before the success message, so a waiting layer was added. Watch for any step that waits on an external service and offer a loading indicator yourself."}], "edges": [{"source": "skill_user_journey", "target": "skill_task_11_1_journey_text", "relation": "implements", "confide